## HIGH

1. **REGRESSED：AUTO/fence 交叉缝隙仍未闭合。**

   [vault_lint.py:375](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:375)–401 将 AUTO 和 fence 放在同一互斥状态机；`in_auto` 分支会吞掉 fence opener，并非独立区间源求并集。

   反例：

   ~~~text
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py -->
   ~~~text
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   [[A]]
   ~~~
   ~~~

   MarkdownIt：`html_block + fence`，A 位于 fence 内；真实 CLI 却输出：

   ```text
   rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound_targets=1
   ```

   即隐藏真孤儿。反方向“fence 在 AUTO 内关闭”又会残留 `fence_re`，把 AUTO 后的真实链接误盲成 `rc=2/A孤儿`。UAT 甚至仍在 [UAT:177](</Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:177>) 明写该交叉“不处理”。

2. **NEW：盲区内反引号会污染全文 code-span 配对。**

   [vault_lint.py:335](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:335)–356、:402–405 在原始全文配对 backtick，没有先排除 HTML/AUTO/fence 区域内的 delimiter。

   ```text
   <!-- ` -->
   ` [[A]] `
   ```

   MarkdownIt 为 `html_block + code_inline('[[A]]')`，A 应为孤儿；实现却用 comment 内 tick 消耗真实 opener，CLI 假绿：

   ```text
   rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound_targets=1
   ```

   这是 round-7 重构引入的跨区间源串扰。

3. **REGRESSED：转义处理跳过整个 maximal run，广义 M1 整改不成立。**

   [vault_lint.py:336](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:336)–344 对奇数反斜杠前缀直接跳过整段反引号。

   输入为“一反斜杠 + 两个 tick + `[[A]]` + 一个 tick”：

   ```text
   \``[[A]]`
   ```

   CommonMark/MarkdownIt 将第一个 tick 视为转义字符、第二个作为 span opener；A 在 code 内。当前却得到：

   ```text
   intervals=[] targets=['a']
   CLI: rc=0 status=ok findings=[]
   ```

   因而隐藏孤儿。相反，span 内 `\`` 不处理反斜杠转义时，当前实现又会跳过真实 closer，产生 `rc=2/A孤儿`。现有 [测试:1092](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1092) 只覆盖两个独立单 tick。

4. **NEW：fence 区间源不支持 CommonMark 容器。**

   [vault_lint.py:379](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:379)–400 仅识别 strip 后直接以 fence 开头的行。

   ```text
   > ~~~text
   > [[A]]
   > ~~~
   ```

   MarkdownIt：`blockquote_open + fence + blockquote_close`；真实 CLI：

   ```text
   rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound_targets=1
   ```

   列表容器同类失守。反方向，四空格缩进的 `~~~` 本应是 indented code，却被 `line.strip()` 错当 fence，导致后面的真实 `[[A]]` 被误盲。

5. **NEW：MANIFEST 当前字节绑定失效。**

   [MANIFEST:54](</Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g82/MANIFEST.txt:54>) 记录 `live-window-round7.txt = 9d5ab3…`，当前文件实算为 `08242d…`。MANIFEST 时间为 `20:49:32`，该文件在 `20:50:17` 后改。

   ```text
   source/test: 5/5 OK
   evidence path coverage: 77/77
   evidence checksum: 76/77 OK
   live-window-round7.txt: FAILED
   ```

   因此 [UAT:89](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:89)–93 与 [MANIFEST:90](</Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g82/MANIFEST.txt:90>) 的“终态证据绑定当前字节”不成立。

